{"page":485,"verses":[{"verse_key":"42:16","surah":42,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يُحَآجُّونَ فِى ٱللَّهِ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا ٱسْتُجِيبَ لَهُۥ حُجَّتُهُمْ دَاحِضَةٌ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ وَعَلَيْهِمْ غَضَبٌ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who argue about God after He has been acknowledged, their argument has no weight with their Lord: anger will fall upon them and agonizing torment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُحَآجُّونَ","en_gloss":"argue","transliteration":"yuḥājjūna","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"concerning","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"[what]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱسْتُجِيبَ","en_gloss":"response has been made to Him","transliteration":"us'tujība","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"response has been made to Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حُجَّتُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their argument","transliteration":"ḥujjatuhum","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"دَاحِضَةٌ","en_gloss":"(is) invalid","transliteration":"dāḥiḍatun","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَعَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"and upon them","transliteration":"waʿalayhim","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"غَضَبٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) wrath","transliteration":"ghaḍabun","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":18,"ar":"شَدِيدٌ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdun","verse_key":"42:16"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:16"}]},{"verse_key":"42:17","surah":42,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنزَلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَٱلْمِيزَانَ ۗ وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّ ٱلسَّاعَةَ قَرِيبٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is God who has sent down the Scripture with Truth and the Balance. How can you tell? The Last Hour may well be near:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"(has) sent down","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"in truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْمِيزَانَ ۗ","en_gloss":"and the Balance","transliteration":"wal-mīzāna","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُدْرِيكَ","en_gloss":"will make you know","transliteration":"yud'rīka","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَعَلَّ","en_gloss":"Perhaps","transliteration":"laʿalla","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","en_gloss":"the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَرِيبٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) near","transliteration":"qarībun","verse_key":"42:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:17"}]},{"verse_key":"42:18","surah":42,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"يَسْتَعْجِلُ بِهَا ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِهَا ۖ وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ مُشْفِقُونَ مِنْهَا وَيَعْلَمُونَ أَنَّهَا ٱلْحَق